  "goodToKnow": "Delegieren means to delegate tasks (Aufgaben delegieren, a key leadership skill) or to send someone as a delegate: zum Parteitag delegiert werden. Der/die Delegierte is a delegate, and die Delegation a delegation. German parties choose leaders and candidates at party conferences (Parteitage) made up of Delegierte from local branches. Perfect without ge-: hat delegiert."
